00:34:43.820 --> 00:34:44.660
incluso si la máquina

00:34:44.660 --> 00:34:46.100
haya cambiado de estado nuevamente.

00:34:46.100 --> 00:34:47.780
El asistente debe preservar

00:34:47.780 --> 00:34:48.840
